  remediation: ['Towns mainly have ______ and services.', 'The gradual change from village to city is a ______.', 'Villages are mainly ______.'], remediationAnswers: '1. trade (industry) 2. continuum 3. agricultural',
  homework: 'Compare your village and a nearby town using four criteria.', homeworkTag: 'This prepares Lesson 10: The Urban Settlement.',
